<title>SINGAPORE: Reuters average December Tapis assessed at $25.355.</title>
<headline>Reuters average December Tapis assessed at $25.355.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average Reuter price for Malaysia Tapis crude during December was $25.355 per barrel.</p>
<p>Malaysia's state-owned Petronas uses Reuters morning quotes in its monthly term crude formula.</p>
<p>Reuters prices:</p>
<p>December 2 $24.45   12 $24.95     24 $25.80</p>
<p>	   3 $24.45   13 $24.55     25 $25.80</p>
<p>	   4 $24.75   16 $25.40     26 $25.80</p>
<p>	   5 $24.75   17 $25.15     27 $25.80</p>
<p>	   6 $24.80   18 $25.73     30 $26.20</p>
<p>	   9 $25.20   19 $25.45     31 $26.15</p>
<p>	  10 $25.55   20 $25.78</p>
<p>	  11 $25.55   23 $25.75</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
